    ],
    "summary" : "The multimedia discipline: say what is playing, drive the transport, and find a song in the Apple Music catalog. An application joins this discipline by declaring a `mediaSurface` — where its transport lives — which is what lets Mary read its state without naming it in Swift. THE LIBRARY IS NOT HERE, and its absence is deliberate rather than an oversight: playlists, library search and track ratings were Apple Events in the plugin this descends from, and Mary sends none and asks for no Automation grant. They wait on a lane this build does not have.",
    "tint" : "#FC5C7D",
    "title" : "Multimedia",
